DECISIONS / DESIGN (inside constraints; reported, not asked)
- Reused the SG-037 planning shape: one vision op `extract_items`, 1x1 white carrier PNG,
  frozen prompt with front-matter template_version, at most one repair turn.
- Grounding encoding: each ExtractionOutput item is one summary sentence; `item.lot` is the
  cited stat id. A response with zero citations, or one citing an id absent from the supplied
  stats, is a loud 502 (never trimmed). This makes the grounding check total (no vacuity).
- Household existence is a 404 at the route; collection isolation is by household_id query
  (a collection endpoint has no foreign resource id, so 403 does not apply; disjoint data proved).
- Live-run mechanism under "no deploy/restart" (PG-PR-04): the one authorized run executes the
  SAME service function in a host process against the live SQLite file the backend mounts
  (/home/andrei/StorageGenie/data/db/storagegenie.db -> container /data/db/storagegenie.db) with
  the live .env key/consent. The running server process is untouched. Tension flagged in report.
